### Run it

After extracting the ZIP:

```bash
python -m venv .venv
pip install -e ".[test]"
pytest -q
cryptosync-demo
```

The demonstration produced:

```json
{
  "bootstrap": "VERIFIED",
  "qve": "VERIFIED",
  "qcp": "PASS",
  "validators": 7,
